207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Quality in aviation refers to the degree to which an airline's services and products meet predetermined standards and fulfil customer expectations while ensuring safety, reliability, and efficiency. In the context of Saudi Arabian Airlines \(Saudia\), quality encompasses not only the operational aspects of flight services but also encompasses customer service, maintenance, and overall passenger experience from ticket booking to arrival.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
