/T (1. Using real-time monitoring tools enables the airline to track system performance continuously and respond to issues as they arise. 2. Implement Performance Monitoring Software \(e.g., application performance management tools\) that tracks system health regarding response times, server loads, and error rates. 3 .Set up alerts for critical performance thresholds \(e.g., if the average response time exceeds 2 seconds\) so that the IT team can address these issues proactively.)
